## Before any edit

1. Read the current owner binding first.
2. Resolve the exact PR, branch, and head SHA.
3. Read the relevant current source/test/domain authority.
4. Identify the precise conflict or requested change; preserve compatible material.
5. Add or update a focused failing regression contract first when practical.
6. Make the smallest correct change; no unrelated refactors.
7. Never rewrite applied historical migrations; use only separately authorized forward repair when needed.

